      "bbox": [
        294,
        540,
        1461,
        904
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Deputy Mayor for Public Safety Milton Mollen is an outstanding former jurist who possesses the highest standards of integrity, is knowledgeable regarding the questions of law and appropriate conduct arising in the context of disqualifications or recusals by public officials, and possesses the judgment to assume this delegated responsibility;",
